    <string name="pair_wrong_code">That code did not work. Check the digits in the dialog and try again.</string>
    <string name="pair_dialog_missing">The pairing dialog was not found. Keep it open while pairing.</string>
    <string name="problem_no_wifi">Connect to Wi-Fi first: wireless debugging works only on Wi-Fi. The network does not need internet access, any network will do, even one without a route to the internet. Wi-Fi is needed just to start the helper.</string>
    <string name="problem_debugging_off">Turn on Wireless debugging in Developer options, then try again.</string>
